# Normalise line endings in the repository and check out LF everywhere.
#
# This is not cosmetic: sleep-check.sh is run as `sh memory/tools/sleep-check.sh`, and a shell
# script committed with CRLF fails on Linux and macOS with "bad interpreter". The repository is
# meant to be cloned on any machine, so LF is the only safe answer.
* text=auto eol=lf
